   "rot": 0,
   "params": {
    "text": "Classic three-stage amplifier at +/-15 V: PNP input pair VT2/VT3 with a current-source tail (VT1), VAS VT4 with a current-source load (VT5), complementary feedback pair output.",
    "size": "10"
   },
   "label": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "n1_77",
   "type": "note",
   "x": 110,
   "y": 968,
   "rot": 0,
   "params": {
    "text": "All SMD: MMBTA92/MMBTA42 small-signal, BCP56/BCP53 (SOT-223) drivers, MJB41C/MJB42C (D2PAK) outputs; 12 W into 8 ohm at 1 % THD.",
    "size": "10"
   },
   "label": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "n2_77",
   "type": "note",
   "x": 110,
   "y": 986,
   "rot": 0,
   "params": {
    "text": "RP1 on the Vbe multiplier VT10 sets the quiescent current (about 30 mA). Gain RF1/RF2 + 1 = 23 (27 dB).",
